            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Added
- **Antigravity desktop app.** Threads from the Antigravity app now appear in
  the panel and the Fleet window, alongside the Antigravity CLI. A thread shows
  as running only while it is working and the app is open.
- **Hide usage in the panel.** Settings → Menu bar → Show usage in the panel.
]]></description>
